{
  "info": {
    "name": "Shop Book API",
    "description": "Manual tests for the Shop Book server, following docs/api.md. Set the collection variable baseUrl (default http://localhost:3000). Run the server with `npm run dev` first. Postman keeps the session cookie between requests, like a phone's browser. In development, every email (with its link) is printed in the server's terminal: copy the token from the link into the `token` variable for the confirm and reset requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
